    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wizzy the Wood</strong> is a charming 3D platformer adventure game with a relaxed pace and a rich, magical world. You play as Wizzy, a wooden being from the storied Forrestian tribe, who embarks on a heroic journey to retrieve the legendary Stone of Eternity stolen by the dark sorcerer Malachite. Only by reclaiming this powerful artifact can Wizzy save his people from doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant, stylized environments filled with secrets, puzzles, and magic. Face off against mischievous creatures, powerful bosses, and overcome a variety of challenges that blend platforming, exploration, and logic-based puzzles. From mysterious forests to forgotten ruins, every corner of Wizzy's world is packed with lore, clues, and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by beloved adventure classics like Croc and Spyro, as well as retro gems like Dizzy, Wizzy the Wood blends nostalgic 3D platforming with modern, family-friendly design. Whether you're a seasoned gamer or simply looking for a cozy adventure, Wizzy\u2019s journey offers accessible, low-stress fun for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Classic 3D platforming</strong> \u2013 Nostalgic gameplay inspired by legendary 3D adventure titles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized and colorful world</strong> \u2013 Hand-crafted environments full of charm, character, and magical details</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzles &amp; exploration</strong> \u2013 Solve environmental and logic-based puzzles while discovering hidden paths and lore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Epic boss battles</strong> \u2013 Face off against unique enemies and magical creatures in story-driven encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Lore-rich adventure</strong> \u2013 Dive into a light fantasy narrative with secrets and world-building elements to uncover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Single-player experience</strong> \u2013 A focused third-person adventure with a relaxing pace and intuitive controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67 <strong>Family-friendly gameplay</strong> \u2013 Safe for all ages, perfect for casual play sessions and younger players</p>",
